				1181,
				1
			],
			"Message": "feat(Cocoon): Route $prepare* language provider methods through gRPC\n\nExtend the method routing in GRPCServerService to match `$prepareCallHierarchyItems`, `$prepareTypeHierarchyItems`, and similar `$prepare*` language feature invocations alongside the existing `$provide*` and `$resolve*` patterns.\n\nMountain calls these when Sky's Monaco editor requests call/type hierarchy intelligence. Previously, the regex gate at Line 796 would drop these requests before they reached InvokeLanguageProvider, causing hierarchy features to silently fail in the extension host.\n\nHierarchy provider requests now route correctly through the language provider invocation pipeline.",
			"SHA": "32219605d70b0c4c3b3e2033b6c63fc4636c7337"
		},
